  <p class="eyebrow">Mailbox stores</p>
  <h1>List your mailbox store</h1>
  <p>If you rent private mailboxes and those facts are published on your website or a public listing page, we want the record to be accurate — especially 24-hour lobby access, the carriers you accept, mail scanning, and whether boxes are currently available.</p>
  <p>Send:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Business name and the city or neighborhood</li>
    <li>Street address, phone, and website</li>
    <li>Staffed hours for each day, and whether mailbox customers have 24-hour lobby access</li>
    <li>Which carriers you accept for mailbox customers (for example USPS, UPS, FedEx, DHL, Amazon)</li>
    <li>Whether you offer mail scanning or forwarding</li>
    <li>A public page where we can verify those facts</li>
  </ul>
  <p>We will not publish hours or services we cannot check on a public source, and we may recrawl your page before each update.</p>
  <p>
    <a class="button" href="mailto:{{ site.emailListings }}?subject=List%20a%20mailbox%20store">Email {{ site.emailListings }}</a>
  </p>
</article>
